 "help": {
  "tabs": [
   {
    "id": "overview",
    "title": "⟦h¦¦Overview⟧",
    "content": "<p>⟦r¦¦This screen is used for managing your installed themes. Aside from the default theme(s) included with your WordPress installation, themes are designed and developed by third parties.⟧</p><p>⟦r¦¦From this screen you can:⟧</p><ul><li>⟦r¦¦Hover or tap to see Activate and Live Preview buttons.⟧</li><li>⟦r¦¦Click Customize for the active theme or Live Preview for any other theme to see a live preview.⟧</li><li>⟦r¦¦Click on a theme to open the Theme Details dialog and see the theme name, version, author, description, tags, and the Delete link.⟧</li><li>⟦r¦¦Use the buttons at the top of the dialog, or <code>alt</code>/<code>option</code> plus the left or right arrow keys on your keyboard, to navigate between themes quickly.⟧</li></ul><p>⟦r¦¦The active theme is displayed highlighted as the first theme.⟧</p><p>⟦r¦¦The search for installed themes will search for terms in their name, description, author, or tag.⟧ <span id=\"live-search-desc\">⟦r¦¦The search results will be updated as you type.⟧</span></p>"
   },
   {
    "id": "adding-themes",
    "title": "⟦h¦¦Adding Themes⟧",
    "content": "<p>⟦r¦¦If you would like to see more themes to choose from, click on the &#8220;Add Theme&#8221; button and you will be able to browse or search for additional themes from the <a href=\"⟪%s¦⟦r¦¦https://wordpress.org/themes/⟧⟫\">WordPress Theme Directory</a>. Themes in the WordPress Theme Directory are designed and developed by third parties, and are compatible with the license WordPress uses. Oh, and they are free!⟧</p>"
   },
   {
    "id": "customize-preview-themes",
    "title": "⟦h¦¦Previewing and Customizing⟧",
    "content": "<p>⟦r¦¦Tap or hover on any theme then click the Live Preview button to see a live preview of that theme and change theme options in a separate, full-screen view. You can also find a Live Preview button at the bottom of the theme details screen. Any installed theme can be previewed and customized in this way.⟧</p><p>⟦r¦¦The theme being previewed is fully interactive &mdash; navigate to different pages to see how the theme handles posts, archives, and other page templates. The settings may differ depending on what theme features the theme being previewed supports. To accept the new settings and activate the theme all in one step, click the Activate &amp; Publish button above the menu.⟧</p><p>⟦r¦¦When previewing on smaller monitors, you can use the collapse icon at the bottom of the left-hand pane. This will hide the pane, giving you more room to preview your site in the new theme. To bring the pane back, click on the collapse icon again.⟧</p>"
   },
   {
    "id": "plugins-themes-auto-updates",
    "title": "⟦h¦¦Auto-updates⟧",
    "content": "<p>⟦r¦¦Auto-updates can be enabled or disabled for each individual theme. Themes with auto-updates enabled will display the estimated date of the next auto-update. Auto-updates depends on the WP-Cron task scheduling system.⟧</p><p>⟦r¦¦Please note: Third-party themes and plugins, or custom code, may override WordPress scheduling.⟧</p>"
   }
  ],
  "sidebar": "<p><strong>⟦r¦¦For more information:⟧</strong></p><p>⟦r¦¦<a href=\"https://wordpress.org/documentation/article/work-with-themes/\">Documentation on Using Themes</a>⟧</p><p>⟦r¦¦<a href=\"https://wordpress.org/documentation/article/appearance-themes-screen/\">Documentation on Managing Themes</a>⟧</p><p>⟦r¦¦<a href=\"https://wordpress.org/documentation/article/plugins-themes-auto-updates/\">Documentation on Auto-updates</a>⟧</p><p>⟦r¦¦<a href=\"https://wordpress.org/support/forums/\">Support forums</a>⟧</p>"
 },
 "content": "\n<div class=\"wrap\">\n\t<h1 class=\"wp-heading-inline\">⟦h¦¦Themes⟧\t\t<span class=\"title-count theme-count\">{{count}}</span>\n\t</h1>\n\t\t\t<a href=\"{{site}}/wp-admin/theme-install.php\" class=\"hide-if-no-js page-title-action\">⟦h¦¦Add Theme⟧</a>\n\t\t<hr class=\"wp-header-end\">\n\t<form class=\"search-form search-themes\"><p class=\"search-box\"></p></form>\n\n{{notices}}<div class=\"theme-browser\">\n\t<div class=\"themes wp-clearfix\">\n\n{{cards}}\t</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"theme-overlay\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"dialog\" aria-label=\"⟦a¦¦Theme Details⟧\"></div>\n\n<p class=\"no-themes\">⟦r¦¦No themes found. Try a different search.⟧</p>\n\n</div><!-- .wrap -->\n\n<script id=\"tmpl-theme\" type=\"text/template\">\n\t<# if ( data.screenshot[0] ) { #>\n\t\t<div class=\"theme-screenshot\">\n\t\t\t<img src=\"{{ data.screenshot[0] }}?ver={{ data.version }}\" alt=\"\" />\n\t\t</div>\n\t<# } else { #>\n\t\t<div class=\"theme-screenshot blank\"></div>\n\t<# } #>\n\n\t<# if ( data.hasUpdate ) { #>\n\t\t<# if ( data.updateResponse.compatibleWP && data.updateResponse.compatiblePHP ) { #>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"update-message notice inline notice-warning notice-alt\"><p>\n\t\t\t\t<# if ( data.hasPackage ) { #>\n\t\t\t\t\t⟦r¦¦New version available. <button class=\"button-link\" type=\"button\">Update now</button>⟧\t\t\t\t<# } else { #>\n\t\t\t\t\t⟦r¦¦New version available.⟧\t\t\t\t<# } #>\n\t\t\t</p></div>\n\t\t<# } else { #>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"update-message notice inline notice-error notice-alt\"><p>\n\t\t\t\t<# if ( ! data.updateResponse.compatibleWP && ! data.updateResponse.compatiblePHP ) { #>\n\t\t\t\t\t⟦r¦¦There is a new version of ⟪%s¦{{{ data.name }}}⟫ available, but it does not work with your versions of WordPress and PHP.⟧ ⟦r¦¦<a href=\"⟪%1$s¦{{site}}/wp-admin/update-core.php⟫\">Please update WordPress</a>, and then <a href=\"⟪%2$s¦⟦r¦localized PHP upgrade information page¦https://wordpress.org/support/update-php/⟧⟫\">learn more about updating PHP</a>.⟧\t\t\t\t<# } else if ( ! data.updateResponse.compatibleWP ) { #>\n\t\t\t\t\t⟦r¦¦There is a new version of ⟪%s¦{{{ data.name }}}⟫ available, but it does not work with your version of WordPress.⟧ ⟦r¦¦<a href=\"⟪%s¦{{site}}/wp-admin/update-core.php⟫\">Please update WordPress</a>.⟧\t\t\t\t<# } else if ( ! data.updateResponse.compatiblePHP ) { #>\n\t\t\t\t\t⟦r¦¦There is a new version of ⟪%s¦{{{ data.name }}}⟫ available, but it does not work with your version of PHP.⟧ ⟦r¦¦<a href=\"⟪%s¦⟦r¦localized PHP upgrade information page¦https://wordpress.org/support/update-php/⟧⟫\">Learn more about updating PHP</a>.⟧\t\t\t\t<# } #>\n\t\t\t</p></div>\n\t\t<# } #>\n\t<# } #>\n\n\t<# if ( ! data.compatibleWP || ! data.compatiblePHP ) { #>\n\t\t<div class=\"notice notice-error notice-alt\"><p>\n\t\t\t<# if ( ! data.compatibleWP && ! data.compatiblePHP ) { #>\n\t\t\t\t⟦r¦¦This theme does not work with your versions of WordPress and PHP.⟧ ⟦r¦¦<a href=\"⟪%1$s¦{{site}}/wp-admin/update-core.php⟫\">Please update WordPress</a>, and then <a href=\"⟪%2$s¦⟦r¦localized PHP upgrade information page¦https://wordpress.org/support/update-php/⟧⟫\">learn more about updating PHP</a>.⟧\t\t\t<# } else if ( ! data.compatibleWP ) { #>\n\t\t\t\t⟦r¦¦This theme does not work with your version of WordPress.⟧ ⟦r¦¦<a href=\"⟪%s¦{{site}}/wp-admin/update-core.php⟫\">Please update WordPress</a>.⟧\t\t\t<# } else if ( ! data.compatiblePHP ) { #>\n\t\t\t\t⟦r¦¦This theme does not work with your version of PHP.⟧ ⟦r¦¦<a href=\"⟪%s¦⟦r¦localized PHP upgrade information page¦https://wordpress.org/support/update-php/⟧⟫\">Learn more about updating PHP</a>.⟧\t\t\t<# } #>\n\t\t</p></div>\n\t<# } #>\n\n\t\t<button type=\"button\" class=\"more-details\" id=\"{{ data.id }}-action\"\n\t\taria-label=\"⟦a¦theme¦View Theme Details for ⟪%s¦{{ data.name }}⟫⟧\"\n\t>⟦r¦¦Theme Details⟧</button>\n\t<div class=\"theme-author\">\n\t\t⟦r¦¦By ⟪%s¦{{{ data.author }}}⟫⟧\t</div>\n\n\t<div class=\"theme-id-container\">\n\t\t<# if ( data.active ) { #>\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"theme-name\" id=\"{{ data.id }}-name\">\n\t\t\t\t<span>⟦r¦theme¦Active:⟧</span> {{{ data.name }}}\n\t\t\t</h2>\n\t\t<# } else { #>\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"theme-name\" id=\"{{ data.id }}-name\">{{{ data.name }}}</h2>\n\t\t<# } #>\n\n\t\t<div class=\"theme-actions\">\n\t\t\t<# if ( data.active ) { #>\n\t\t\t\t<# if ( data.actions.customize ) { #>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a class=\"button button-compact button-primary customize load-customize hide-if-no-customize\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\thref=\"{{{ data.actions.customize }}}\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\taria-label=\"⟦a¦theme¦Customize ⟪%s¦{{ data.name }}⟫⟧\"\n\t\t\t\t\t>⟦r¦¦Customize⟧</a>\n\t\t\t\t<# } #>\n\t\t\t<# } else { #>\n\t\t\t\t<# if ( data.compatibleWP && data.compatiblePHP ) { #>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a class=\"button button-compact activate\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\thref=\"{{{ data.actions.activate }}}\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\taria-label=\"⟦a¦theme¦Activate ⟪%s¦{{ data.name }}⟫⟧\"\n\t\t\t\t\t>⟦r¦¦Activate⟧</a>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a class=\"button button-compact button-primary load-customize hide-if-no-customize\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\thref=\"{{{ data.actions.customize }}}\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\taria-label=\"⟦a¦theme¦Live Preview ⟪%s¦{{ data.name }}⟫⟧\"\n\t\t\t\t\t>⟦r¦¦Live Preview⟧</a>\n\t\t\t\t<# } else { #>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a class=\"button button-compact disabled\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\taria-label=\"⟦a¦theme¦Cannot Activate ⟪%s¦{{ data.name }}⟫⟧\"\n\t\t\t\t\t>⟦r¦theme¦Cannot Activate⟧</a>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a class=\"button button-compact button-primary hide-if-no-customize disabled\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\taria-label=\"⟦a¦theme¦Live Preview ⟪%s¦{{ data.name }}⟫⟧\"\n\t\t\t\t\t>⟦r¦¦Live Preview⟧</a>\n\t\t\t\t<# } #>\n\t\t\t<# } #>\n\t\t</div>\n\t</div>\n</script>\n\n<script id=\"tmpl-theme-single\" type=\"text/template\">\n\t<div class=\"theme-backdrop\"></div>\n\t<div class=\"theme-wrap wp-clearfix\" role=\"document\">\n\t\t<div class=\"theme-header\">\n\t\t\t<button class=\"left dashicons dashicons-no\"><span class=\"screen-reader-text\">\n\t\t\t\t⟦r¦¦Show previous theme⟧\t\t\t</span></button>\n\t\t\t<button class=\"right dashicons dashicons-no\"><span class=\"screen-reader-text\">\n\t\t\t\t⟦r¦¦Show next theme⟧\t\t\t</span></button>\n\t\t\t<button class=\"close dashicons dashicons-no\"><span class=\"screen-reader-text\">\n\t\t\t\t⟦r¦¦Close details dialog⟧\t\t\t</span></button>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"theme-about wp-clearfix\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"theme-screenshots\">\n\t\t\t<# if ( data.screenshot[0] ) { #>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"screenshot\"><img src=\"{{ data.screenshot[0] }}?ver={{ data.version }}\" alt=\"\" /></div>\n\t\t\t<# } else { #>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"screenshot blank\"></div>\n\t\t\t<# } #>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t\t<div class=\"theme-info\">\n\t\t\t\t<# if ( data.active ) { #>\n\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"current-label\">⟦r¦¦Active Theme⟧</span>\n\t\t\t\t<# } #>\n\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"theme-name\">{{{ data.name }}}<span class=\"theme-version\">\n\t\t\t\t\t⟦r¦¦Version: ⟪%s¦{{ data.version }}⟫⟧\t\t\t\t</span></h2>\n\t\t\t\t<p class=\"theme-author\">\n\t\t\t\t\t⟦r¦¦By ⟪%s¦{{{ data.authorAndUri }}}⟫⟧\t\t\t\t</p>\n\n\t\t\t\t<# if ( ! data.compatibleWP || ! data.compatiblePHP ) { #>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"notice notice-error notice-alt notice-large\"><p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<# if ( ! data.compatibleWP && ! data.compatiblePHP ) { #>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t⟦r¦¦This theme does not work with your versions of WordPress and PHP.⟧ ⟦r¦¦<a href=\"⟪%1$s¦{{site}}/wp-admin/update-core.php⟫\">Please update WordPress</a>, and then <a href=\"⟪%2$s¦⟦r¦localized PHP upgrade information page¦https://wordpress.org/support/update-php/⟧⟫\">learn more about updating PHP</a>.⟧\t\t\t\t\t\t<# } else if ( ! data.compatibleWP ) { #>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t⟦r¦¦This theme does not work with your version of WordPress.⟧ ⟦r¦¦<a href=\"⟪%s¦{{site}}/wp-admin/update-core.php⟫\">Please update WordPress</a>.⟧\t\t\t\t\t\t<# } else if ( ! data.compatiblePHP ) { #>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t⟦r¦¦This theme does not work with your version of PHP.⟧ ⟦r¦¦<a href=\"⟪%s¦⟦r¦localized